Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat: connected journey (contract v1): SkillLens link,
 YoID thread, back to the listing

Only with ?journey=demo; without it PathFinder behaves as before.

- engine/journey.js: link building (every received param passed on plus
  PathFinder's own, return last and unchanged, pilot code never passed on),
  http(s)-only return check, YoID thread states for Phase 2.
- "Continue to SkillLens" is the contract's link 2 and opens in the same tab.
- Arriving/leaving handoff cards in the contract's exact wording, Yoma colours.
- YoID thread strip and "Back to the listing" link at the top of the page.
- Each plan step names its platform (P2E, Yoma, imaGen); the plan ends with
  the weekly WhatsApp / SMS check-in.
- NEXT_PROTOTYPE_URL defaults to SkillLens's /demo/p2e in .env.example;
  SKILLLENS_URL + /demo/p2e is used when it is empty.
- Tests: test/journey.test.mjs, served-file check, e2e journey scenarios.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
